Package: frubase
Title: FRUBASE, a Dataset of Fleshy Fruit Traits
Version: 4.0
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Jordano", email = "jordano@ebd.csic.es", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A database of fleshy fruit traits for over 900 Angiosperm plant
    species worldwide, compiled from published literature and original
    fieldwork. Records include taxonomy, fruit morphology (size and mass),
    pulp and seed nutritional composition, disperser type, and geographic
    origin.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/pedroj/FRUBASE
BugReports: https://github.com/pedroj/FRUBASE/issues
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
LazyDataCompression: xz
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
